   "location": "Chart area, single teal line with black circular markers, one per year from 2005 to 2014.",
   "fact": "The line begins near the top of the plot in 2005 and descends steadily to the right, ending near the bottom in 2014. The 2005 and 2006 markers are at the same apparent height; the 2010 and 2011 markers are at nearly the same height; all other consecutive markers step downward."
