  },
  {
   "location": "Vertical extent of the plotted line.",
   "fact": "The line spans from just above the 20 gridline (2005) to just above the 10 gridline (2014), covering roughly the upper half of the visible 0-to-20+ axis."
  },
  {
   "location": "2007, 2008, 2009 markers.",
   "fact": "Each is lower than the previous, stepping down between the 20 and 15 gridlines, with 2009 sitting just below the 20 gridline."
  },
  {
   "location": "2010, 2011 markers.",
   "fact": "Both sit just above the 15 gridline, with 2011 marginally lower than 2010."
  },
  {
   "location": "2012, 2013 markers.",
   "fact": "2012 is just below the 15 gridline; 2013 is between the 10 and 15 gridlines, closer to 10."
  },
  {
   "location": "Overall trend shape.",
   "fact": "Monotonically non-increasing across the decade, with the largest single-step drops appearing between 2006-2007 and 2008-2009; the total vertical drop from 2005 to 2014 is large relative to the axis span."
